{"schemaVersion":2,"sectionID":20019857,"chapterID":15000801,"chapterNumber":"VIII-1","sectionNumber":"81-04","title":"Subdistricts and Subareas","officialText":"","previewText":"In order to carry out the purposes and provisions of this Chapter, five special Subdistricts are established within the Special Midtown District. In each of these Subdistricts certain special regulations apply which do not apply in the remainder of the Special Midtown District. The Subdistricts are outlined on Map 1 (Special Midtown District and Subdistricts) in Appendix A of this Chapter.\n\nThe Subdistricts, together","blocks":[{"id":"zr-19857-block-001","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>In order to carry out the purposes and provisions of this Chapter, five special Subdistricts are established within the <strong><em>Special Midtown District</em></strong>. In each of these Subdistricts certain special regulations apply which do not apply in the remainder of the <strong><em>Special Midtown District</em></strong>. The Subdistricts are outlined on Map 1 (Special Midtown District and Subdistricts) in Appendix A of this Chapter.</span></p>","plainText":"In order to carry out the purposes and provisions of this Chapter, five special Subdistricts are established within the Special Midtown District. In each of these Subdistricts certain special regulations apply which do not apply in the remainder of the Special Midtown District. The Subdistricts are outlined on Map 1 (Special Midtown District and Subdistricts) in Appendix A of this Chapter."},{"id":"zr-19857-block-002","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>The Subdistricts, together with the Sections of this Chapter specially applying to each, are as follows:</span></p>","plainText":"The Subdistricts, together with the Sections of this Chapter specially applying to each, are as follows:"},{"id":"zr-19857-block-003","kind":"html","html":"<a id=\"t.abb0edd459047e10a9b7be318846a2efc0158378\"></a>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-19857-block-004","kind":"html","htm