v/article-viii/chapter-1#81-023\" data-permitext-zr-source=\"https://zr.planning.nyc.gov/article-viii/chapter-1#81-023\"><span>81-023</span></a>, the <strong><em>Special Clinton District</em></strong> and the underlying districts, except as otherwise specifically provided in the Subdistrict regulations themselves.</span></p>","plainText":"The Subdistricts are also subject to all other regulations of the Special Midtown District and, where applicable pursuant to Section 81-023, the Special Clinton District and the underlying districts, except as otherwise specifically provided in the Subdistrict regulations themselves."},{"id":"zr-19857-block-007","kind":"html","html":"<p><span>Within the East Midtown Subdistrict, certain special regulations apply to Subareas that do not apply within the remainder of the Subdistrict. These Subareas are established, as follows:</span></p>","plainText":"Within the East Midtown Subdistrict, certain special regulations apply to Subareas that do not apply within the remainder of the Subdistrict. These Subareas are established, as follows:"},{"id":"zr-19857-block-008","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Grand Central Transit Improvement Zone Subarea</span></p>","plainText":"Grand Central Transit Improvement Zone Subarea"},{"id":"zr-19857-block-009","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-19857-block-010","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Northern Subarea</span></p>","plainText":"Northern Subarea"},{"id":"zr-19857-block-011","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-19857-block-012","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span>Other Transit Improvement Zone Subarea </span></p>","plainText":"Other Transit Improvement Zone Subarea"},{"id":"zr-19857-block-013","kind":"html","html":"<p style=\"margin-left: 43pt;\"><span></span></p>","plainText":""},{"id":"zr-19857-bl